{"id":"n53818-1-10","stage":1,"title":"가져오다 · 带来","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n53818-1-10-1","ko":"서류를 제출하러 왔는데요.","zh":"我是来提交文件的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"서류를","meaning":"文件，材料","explanation":"서류：文件，材料；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"서류","audio":"/audio/e90c4f2356666af132b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62870","senseId":"1","lemma":"서류","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"제출하러","meaning":"提交，出具","explanation":"제출하다：提交，出具；러：用于移动动词前，表示移动的目的：“去/来做……”。","readings":[{"term":"제출하다","audio":"/audio/f956d4ab4c647cd24e7c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63604","senseId":"1","lemma":"제출하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왔는데요.","meaning":"来","explanation":"오다：来；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데요：礼貌地交代背景、感想或含蓄的对照。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"23","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"e90c4f2356666af1","term":"서류","zh":"文件，材料","audio":"/audio/e90c4f2356666af132b3.mp3","entryId":"62870","definition":"用文字记录的文书。","pronunciation":["서류"]},{"id":"f956d4ab4c647cd2","term":"제출하다","zh":"提交，出具","audio":"/audio/f956d4ab4c647cd24e7c.mp3","entryId":"63604","definition":"提出某个案件、意见或文件等。","pronunciation":["제출하다"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"为了某个目的或事情而从别的地方移动到这里。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/11c5b0bcc1cf9aeba7fa.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n53818-1-10-2","ko":"이쪽으로 가져오세요.","zh":"请拿过来这边。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이쪽으로","meaning":"这边","explanation":"이쪽：这边；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"이쪽","audio":"/audio/ceea9a2e61410973dfd8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71694","senseId":"1","lemma":"이쪽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가져오세요.","meaning":"带来，拿来，取来","explanation":"가져오다：带来，拿来，取来；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"가져오다","audio":"/audio/13f6f1041daf74b52d00.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"53818","senseId":"1","lemma":"가져오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ceea9a2e61410973","term":"이쪽","zh":"这边","audio":"/audio/ceea9a2e61410973dfd8.mp3","entryId":"71694","definition":"指代离说话人很近的地方或方向。","pronunciation":["이쪽"]},{"id":"13f6f1041daf74b5","term":"가져오다","zh":"带来，拿来，取来","audio":"/audio/13f6f1041daf74b52d00.mp3","entryId":"53818","definition":"把某个东西从一个地方搬到另一个地方。","pronunciation":["가저오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c42e09eca536bf183e7f.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.38,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=53818","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":44,"sequenceScore":1.9321,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我是来提交文件的。","请拿过来这边。","妈妈！我这次考试考了九十分哦。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我是来提交文件的。","请拿过来这边。","妈妈！我这次考试考了九十分哦。"],"answer":1}]}
